"}]},{"text":"கடியா","tr":"kaṭiyā","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கடி","tr":"kaṭi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"}]},{"text":"தோளே","tr":"tōḷē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளே","tr":"ḷē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"அம்ம","parts":[{"text":"அம்ம","lemma":"அம்ம","gloss":"listen"}],"gloss":"listen"},{"surface":"வாழி","parts":[{"text":"வாழ்","lemma":"வாழ்","gloss":"live"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"இ","gloss":"optative suffix"}],"gloss":"may you live long"},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"தோழி","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"friend"},{"surface":"அன்னைக்","parts":[{"text":"அன்னை","lemma":"அன்னை","gloss":"mother"},{"text":"க்","lemma":"கு","gloss":"dative case suffix"}],"gloss":"to mother"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"குயர்நிலை","parts":[{"text":"க்","lemma":"கு","gloss":"dative suffix remnant"},{"text":"உயர்","lemma":"உயர்","gloss":"high"},{"text":"நிலை","lemma":"நிலை","gloss":"state"}],"gloss":"high state"},{"surface":"உலகமும்","parts":[{"text":"உலகம்","lemma":"உலகம்","gloss":"world"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even the world"},{"surface":"சிறிதால்","parts":[{"text":"சிறிது","lemma":"சிறிது","gloss":"small"},{"text":"ஆல்","lemma":"ஆல்","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"is small indeed"},{"surface":"அவர்","parts":[{"text":"அவர்","lemma":"அவர்","gloss":"he"}],"gloss":"his"},{"surface":"மலை","parts":[{"text":"மலை","lemma":"மலை","gloss":"mountain"}],"gloss":"mountain"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மாலை","parts":[{"text":"மாலை","lemma":"மாலை","gloss":"evening"}],"gloss":"evening"},{"surface":"பெய்த","parts":[{"text":"பெய்","lemma":"பெய்","gloss":"pour"},{"text":"த்","lemma":"த்","gloss":"past tense marker"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"that poured"},{"surface":"மணம்","parts":[{"text":"மணம்","lemma":"மணம்","gloss":"fragrance"}],"gloss":"fragrance"},{"surface":"கமழ்","parts":[{"text":"கமழ்","lemma":"கமழ்","gloss":"emit fragrance"}],"gloss":"emitting"},{"surface":"உந்தியொடு","parts":[{"text":"உந்தி","lemma":"உந்தி","gloss":"stream"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with the stream"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"காலை","parts":[{"text":"காலை","lemma":"காலை","gloss":"morning"}],"gloss":"morning"},{"surface":"வந்த","parts":[{"text":"வந்த","lemma":"வந்த","gloss":"that came"}],"gloss":"that came","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"காந்தள்","parts":[{"text":"காந்தள்","lemma":"காந்தள்","gloss":"glory lily"}],"gloss":"glory lily"},{"surface":"முழு","parts":[{"text":"முழு","lemma":"முழு","gloss":"whole"}],"gloss":"entire"},{"surface":"முதல்","parts":[{"text":"முதல்","lemma":"முதல்","gloss":"root"}],"gloss":"root"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மெல்லிலை","parts":[{"text":"மெல்","lemma":"மெல்","gloss":"soft"},{"text":"இலை","lemma":"இலை","gloss":"leaf"}],"gloss":"soft leaves"},{"surface":"குழைய","parts":[{"text":"குழை","lemma":"குழை","gloss":"wither"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"to wither"},{"surface":"முயங்கலும்","parts":[{"text":"முயங்கு","lemma":"முயங்கு","gloss":"embrace"},{"text":"அல்","lemma":"அல்","gloss":"verbal noun suffix"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"and embracing"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இல்லுய்த்து","parts":[{"text":"இல்","lemma":"இல்","gloss":"house"},{"text":"உய்த்து","lemma":"உய்","gloss":"bring"}],"gloss":"bringing to the house"},{"surface":"நடுதலும்","parts":[{"text":"நடு","lemma":"நடு","gloss":"plant"},{"text":"தல்","lemma":"தல்","gloss":"verbal noun suffix"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"and planting"},{"surface":"கடியா","parts":[{"text":"கடி","lemma":"கடி","gloss":"forbid"},{"text":"ஆ","lemma":"ஆ","gloss":"negative suffix"}],"gloss":"not forbidding"},{"surface":"தோளே","parts":[{"text":"தோள்","lemma":"தோள்","gloss":"she"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"she indeed"}]}],"literal":"Listen, may you live long, friend! To mother, / even the high world is small indeed. From his mountain, / with the fragrance-emitting stream that poured in the evening, / the entire root of the glory lily that came in the morning, / embracing it so that its soft leaves withered, / and bringing it to the house and planting it, she did not forbid.","translation":"Listen, my friend, may you live long! To mother, even the high world of the gods is too small to contain her joy. For, when the stream from his mountain, fragrant from the evening rains, washed down the entire root of a glory lily in the morning, she did not forbid me from embracing it until its soft leaves withered, nor did she prevent me from bringing it home and planting it.","modern":"தோழியே, கேள்! நீ டூழி வாழ்க! அன்னைக்குத் தேவர்களின் உயர்ந்த உலகமும் மிகச் சிறியதாகும். அவனுடைய மலையிலிருந்து மாலை நேரத்தில் பெய்த மழையினால் நறுமணம் வீசி வந்த நீரோட்டத்துடன், காலையில் அடித்து வரப்பட்ட காந்தள் செடியின் முழு வேரையும், அதன் மென்மையான இலைகள் குலையும்படி நான் தழுவிக் கொண்டதையும், அதை வீட்டிற்கு எடுத்து வந்து நட்டதையும் அன்னை தடுக்கவில்லை.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her friend about her mother's reaction to her actions. A glory lily root was washed down from the hero's mountain by the evening rains and arrived with the morning stream. The heroine embraced the plant lovingly, as it came from her lover's mountain, and then brought it home to plant in their garden. Her mother, observing this, did not forbid her, which the heroine interprets as a silent acceptance of her love and a sign that their marriage will soon be approved. This Kuriñci landscape poem uses the glory lily from the hero's mountain as a symbol of the hero himself, and the mother's acceptance of the plant symbolizes her acceptance of the alliance.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.7],[0.7,0.9],[1.02,1.5],[1.62,2.5],[2.5,2.9],[2.9,3.5],[3.5,4.0],[4.0,4.9],[4.9,5.3],[5.3,5.9],[6.1,6.3],[6.3,6.62],[6.62,7.1],[7.1,7.3],[7.3,7.9],[7.9,8.9],[8.9,9.21],[9.21,9.4],[9.4,10.12],[10.12,10.42],[10.42,10.72],[10.72,11.02]],"female":[[0.0,0.36],[0.36,0.6],[0.6,0.9],[1.02,1.5],[1.62,2.5],[2.5,3.1],[3.1,3.6],[3.6,4.3],[4.3,5.1],[5.1,5.4],[5.4,6.2],[6.2,6.8],[6.8,7.6],[7.6,8.0],[8.0,8.4],[8.4,9.0],[9.17,9.67],[9.67,10.11],[10.11,11.0],[11.0,12.0],[12.0,12.5],[12.5,12.8],[12.8,13.0]]},"sync":[[["அம்ம","listen"]],[["வாழி","may you live long"]],[["தோழி","friend"]],[["அன்னைக்","to mother"]],[["குயர்நிலை","high state"]],[["உலகமும்","even the world"]],[["சிறிதால்","is small indeed"]],[["அவர்","his"],["மலை","mountain"]],[["மாலை","evening"]],[["பெய்த","that poured"]],[["மணம்","fragrance"],["கமழ்","emitting"]],[["உந்தியொடு","with the stream"]],[["காலை","morning"]],[["வந்த","that came"]],[["காந்தள்","glory lily"]],[["முழு","entire"],["முதல்","root"]],[["மெல்லிலை","soft leaves"]],[["குழைய","to wither"]],[["முயங்கலும்","and embracing"]],[["இல்லுய்த்து","bringing to the house"]],[["நடுதலும்","and planting"]],[["கடியா","not forbidding"]],[["தோளே","she indeed"]]]}